style=\"display: none;\"></div><div id=\"sound\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"on\"></div></div></div></div><div id=\"big-play\" style=\"display: none;\"></div><div id=\"timer\" style=\"display: none;\"></div><div id=\"close-btn\" style=\"float: right; display: none;\"></div><div id=\"skip-btn\" style=\"display: none;\">Skip</div><div id=\"aniview-credit\" style=\"top: 0px; right: 2px; display: none;\">Ads by<span style=\"height: 20px; width: 55px; background-image: url(&quot;https://cdn.orangeclickmedia.com/assets/ocm-aniview-player-logo.png?v6&quot;);\"></span></div><div id=\"ad-icon\"></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"anibid\"></div></div></div></div><script id=\"AV68c17372b54b08ac660781f8\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://tg1.orangeclickmedia.com/api/adserver/spt?AV_PUBLISHERID=62ed18128bb9d95dbe10e294&amp;AV_TAGID=68c17372b54b08ac660781f8&amp;AV_URL=https://dolenjskilist.svet24.si/novice/pgd-griblje-stoletnica-rojak-franc-brinc-1898805&amp;AV_CUSTOM5=false&amp;AV_CUSTOM8=1&amp;AV_CUSTOM9=2&amp;AV_CUSTOM1=Yes&amp;AV_CUSTOM2=OCM-15&amp;AV_CUSTOM3=positive&amp;AV_CUSTOM7=adsq_bs%3DYes%3Badsq_bs_class%3DOCM-15%3Badsq_bs_sent%3Dpositive%3B&amp;AV_CUSTOM6=ocm_domain%3Ddolenjskilist.svet24.si%26ocm_site_billing%3Ddolenjskilist.svet24.si%26Media24_si_noads%3D0%26page%3DArticle%26Media24_si_pagetype%3Darticle%26Media24_si_articleid%3D1898805%26Media24_si_category%3Dlokalno%2Cdolenjska%2Cnovice%26Media24_si_site%3Ddolenjski-list%26Media24_si_topic%3D%26Media24_si_resource%3Ddolenjski-list%26Media24_URL%3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fdolenjskilist.svet24.si%2Fnovice%2Fpgd-griblje-stoletnica-rojak-franc-brinc-1898805%26Media24_si_tag%3Dpgd-griblje%2Cfranc-brinc%26oeid%3D8cc67ab2-d41d-4166-b91c-8f1e630d0399%26adsq_bs_class%3Docm-15%26adsq_bs_suit%3Dno%20risk\" async=\"\" data-config-api=\"avConfig\" data-player-api=\"avPassback\"></script></div></div><p>Kot pove <b>Matija Štrucelj</b>, poveljnik društva, v katerem je 140 članov, od tega 18 operativnih gasilcev, se želijo s častitljivim jubilejem zahvaliti prednikom, ki so postavljali in dvigovali gasilstvo, ter nakazati obdobje prenove društva. Posebno pozornost namenjajo sistematičnemu delu z mladimi, kar se že pozna tudi na tekmovanjih –&nbsp;tudi v kvizu gasilske mladine –, in nasploh zanimanju za gasilstvo, dodaja.</p>\n<div class=\"not-prose pb-2 border-y sm:border-x my-6 bg-[var(--article-advert-bg)] overflow-hidden max-sm:-mx-4\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-wider uppercase text-[var(--text-details)] p-3 pb-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n        Preberite še\n    </span>\n    <div class=\"p-3 pt-0\">\n        <article class=\"@container/article flex gap-3 items-center max-w-full min-w-0 bg-[var(--article-read-more-bg)] shadow-lg pl-4\">\n    <a href=\"https://svet24.si/novice/zaposlitev/abitura-od-visjesolskega-do-magistrskega-1923930\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"order-last aspect-square bg-slate-300 relative overflow-hidden w-24\">\n        <img class=\"object-cover w-full transition-transform duration-500 lg:hover:scale-105\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"shutterstock_2730984255.jpg\" src=\"//cdn.kme.si/public/images-cache/100x100/2026/09/07/8fc897437759ba3c584d2f2ee66961e0/6a9e72f139fcb/8fc897437759ba3c584d2f2ee66961e0.jpeg\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-slate-400/40 dark:ring-slate-700/40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 flex gap-1\">\n    \n        \n    </div>\n    </a>\n    <div class=\"min-w-0 w-full flex flex-col items-stretch gap-1 flex-1 min-w-0\">\n            <div class=\"mb-1 flex justify-start gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium w-full max-w-full min-w-0 leading-none text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">\n            \n                        \n                        <img class=\"fill-current dark:brightness-180 dark:saturate-40 h-5.5 -my-1.25 min-w-0\" src=\"/images/brands/aligned/svet24.svg\" alt=\"svet24\">\n                                    <span>·</span>\n                        \n                            <a href=\"https://svet24.si/novice/zaposlitev/abitura-od-visjesolskega-do-magistrskega-1923930\" class=\"hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-white line-clamp-1\">Zaposlitev</a>\n                        \n                    </div>\n        \n    <a href=\"https://svet24.si/novice/zaposlitev/abitura-od-visjesolskega-do-magistrskega-1923930\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-black dark:text-slate-200 hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-white w-full col-span-2 line-clamp-3 text-base/snug \">\n            Sodobne oblike študija so prilagodljive in dostopne\n        </h3>\n    </a>\n        </div>\n</article>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ocm-outbrain-inarticle\"></div><p>Društvo je v zadnjih letih ob pomoči Gasilske zveze Črnomelj posodobilo opremo. Imajo vozilo GVC s 700 litri vode za hitro posredovanje, 16 dihalnih aparatov in usposobljene člane, ki skrbijo za hitro, učinkovito in varno ukrepanje ob požarih in drugih nesrečah, pojasnjuje poveljnik. Med željami ostaja nakup kombija, kar bi radi uresničili ob stoletnici.</p>\n<article class=\"flex items-start gap-3 group peer min-w-0 mb-[1.3333em] not-prose shadow-md items-center! border pr-4\">\n                <a href=\"/novice/spominska-plosca-griblje-doktor-franc-brinc-1894366\" class=\"shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden w-2/5 sm:w-1/4 md:w-2/5 aspect-8/5 max-sm:aspect-5/4! w-32! md:w-1/4!\">\n        <img class=\"object-cover w-full transition-transform duration-500 lg:hover:scale-105 bg-slate-300 max-sm:h-full\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"franc-brinc\" src=\"//cdn.kme.si/public/images-cache/800x500/2026/04/21/5a32d14f237586b2013db5c2cf0d1bb1/69e794e0154ab/5a32d14f237586b2013db5c2cf0d1bb1.jpeg\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-slate-400/40 dark:ring-slate-700/40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 flex gap-1\">\n    \n        \n    </div>\n    </a>\n                <div class=\"min-w-0 w-full flex flex-col items-stretch gap-1 col-span-2 items-center flex-1\">\n            <div class=\"mb-1 flex justify-start gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium w-full max-w-full min-w-0 leading-none text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">\n            \n                        \n                                    \n                            <a href=\"/novice/spominska-plosca-griblje-doktor-franc-brinc-1894366\" class=\"hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-white line-clamp-1\">Spominska plošča</a>\n                        \n                    </div>\n        \n    <a href=\"/novice/spominska-plosca-griblje-doktor-franc-brinc-1894366\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-black dark:text-slate-200 hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-white w-full col-span-2 line-clamp-3 text-base/snug lg:text-lg/snug \">\n            Griblje slavile 91 let dobrotnika dr. Brinca, kraju podaril 200.000 evrov\n        </h3>\n    </a>\n        </div>\n    </article>\n\n<p>Pomemben pečat pri razvoju društva je pustil rojak <b>Franc Brinc</b>, ki je v zadnjih štirih letih doniral kar 30 tisoč evrov. »Brez tega ne bi zmogli. Dal nam je zagon in s tem prebudil društvo, ki je bilo v nekem trenutku v rahlem zatonu,«&nbsp;je hvaležen Štrucelj. Novo vnemo gasilcev so prepoznali tudi drugi –&nbsp;skupaj so uredili operativno sobo, lani pa v celoti zamenjali streho in izolacijo ter prenovili še dom, ki je ob različnih dogodkih osrednje zbirališče krajanov.</p>\n<div id=\"inline1\" required=\"\" data-ocm-ad=\"\" width=\"300\" style=\"min-height: 250px\" data-oau-code=\"/75351959,22770360492/dolenjskilist.svet24.si/dl_inline1\"></div><p>»Dve leti pred tem, ko je toča klestila po Beli krajini, ni prizanesla niti našemu domu. Streho je močno poškodovalo, a smo jo nekako popravili, z denarjem našega rojaka pa smo celotni stavbi kasneje dali nov videz,« še pove Matija Štrucelj.</p>\n<article class=\"flex items-start gap-3 group peer min-w-0 mb-[1.3333em] not-prose shadow-md items-center! border pr-4\">\n                <a href=\"/novice/kronika/foto-hude-minute-nad-belo-krajino-v-prilozju-ni-vec-cele-strehe-277868-1723723\" class=\"shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden w-2/5 sm:w-1/4 md:w-2/5 aspect-8/5 max-sm:aspect-5/4! w-32! md:w-1/4!\">\n        <img class=\"object-cover w-full transition-transform duration-500 lg:hover:scale-105 bg-slate-300 max-sm:h-full\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"001_dji_0850.jpg\" src=\"//cdn.kme.si/public/images-cache/800x500/2023/07/20/ce93143dff5fc574200475877b3de103/6793890fcb5e4/ce93143dff5fc574200475877b3de103.jpg\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-slate-400/40 dark:ring-slate-700/40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 flex gap-1\">\n    \n        \n    </div>\n    </a>\n                <div class=\"min-w-0 w-full flex flex-col items-stretch gap-1 col-span-2 items-center flex-1\">\n            <div class=\"mb-1 flex justify-start gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium w-full max-w-full min-w-0 leading-none text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">\n            \n                        \n                                    \n                            <a href=\"/novice/kronika/foto-hude-minute-nad-belo-krajino-v-prilozju-ni-vec-cele-strehe-277868-1723723\" class=\"hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-white line-clamp-1\">Kronika</a>\n                        \n                    </div>\n        \n    <a href=\"/novice/kronika/foto-hude-minute-nad-belo-krajino-v-prilozju-ni-vec-cele-strehe-277868-1723723\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-black dark:text-slate-200 hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-white w-full col-span-2 line-clamp-3 text-base/snug lg:text-lg/snug \">\n            FOTO: Hude minute nad Belo krajino - v Prilozju ni več cele strehe\n        </h3>\n    </a>\n        </div>\n    </article>\n\n<p>Zadovoljstva gasilcev je bil seveda vesel tudi Franc Brinc. Kot pravi, se bo zagotovo udeležil osrednje gasilske proslave ob trimestni obletnici društva, ki je ljudem pomagalo tudi v težkih časih med drugo svetovno vojno, ko je kot otrok obiskoval šolo v domačem kraju.</p>\n\n                                                    \n                \n                \n                                                            <div class=\"@container not-prose flex flex-col justify-between bg-slate-100 mt-12 mb-6 w-full dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl article-promo resource-110 max-w-2xl mx-auto\" data-promo-signup=\"\">\n    <div class=\"h-3 bg-primary-500 w-full relative mb-10 rounded-t-xl\">\n        <span class=\"size-12 rounded-full bg-primary-600 absolute left-1/2 top-0 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-4.5 flex items-center justify-center\">\n            <svg class=\"fill-current size-6 text-white\"><use xlink:href=\"/dist/icons.svg?t=22#envelope\"></use></svg>\n        </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center md:px-6 mb-3\">\n        \n        <div>\n  \n  <img class=\"relative h-5\" src=\"/images/brands/color/dolenjski-list.svg?v=v2026\" alt=\"Dolenjski list\">\n  </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"text-center px-4 py-4\">\n                        <p class=\"text-lg font-medium text-[color:var(--tw-prose-body)]\">Prijavite se na e-novice in bodite vedno na tekočem z novicami, dogodki in zgodbami iz vašega okolja.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"px-4 pb-6 md:px-6 md:pb-8\">\n        <form @submit.prevent=\"subscribe()\" x-data=\"{\n        email: '',\n        agreedToTerms: false,\n        loading: false,\n        subscribed: false,\n        error: null,\n        responseData: null,\n        subscribe() {\n            if (!this.email || !this.agreedToTerms) {\n                this.error = 'Prosimo, izpolnite vsa obvezna polja in se strinjajte s pogoji.';\n                return;\n            }\n\n            this.loading = true;\n            this.error = null;\n\n            fetch('https://api3.m24.si/api/newsletter/subscribe', {\n                method: 'POST',\n                headers: {\n                    'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n                    'X-CSRF-TOKEN': ''\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    email: this.email,\n                    lists: ['dolenjska']\n                })\n            })\n            .then(response =&gt; {\n                if (response.ok) {\n                    // Try to parse JSON, but handle case where there might not be any\n                    return response.json();\n                } else {\n                    throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\n                }\n            })\n            .then(data =&gt; {\n                this.subscribed = true;\n                this.responseData = data;\n            })\n            .catch(error =&gt; {\n                this.error = 'Prišlo je do napake. Preverite internetno povezavo in poskusite znova.';\n            })\n            .finally(() =&gt; {\n                this.loading = false;\n            });\n        }\n    }\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 @container w-full\">\n\n    <div x-show=\"!subscribed\" class=\"grid gap-4 gap-y-2 @lg:grid-cols-[2fr_9rem]\">\n        \n        <div class=\"col-span-full @lg:col-span-1 order-1\">\n            <label for=\"cfa4132b6-9496-481d-8f3f-43ad893ab4e9_newsletter_email\" class=\"sr-only\">Email</label>\n            <input type=\"email\" x-model=\"email\" id=\"cfa4132b6-9496-481d-8f3f-43ad893ab4e9_newsletter_email\" placeholder=\"Vnesite svoj email naslov\" class=\"text-base border border-[var(--input-border)] bg-[var(--input-lv2-bg)] dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-md px-3.5 py-2 w-full text-[var(--input-text)] placeholder:text-[var(--input-placeholder)] focus:outline-2 focus:-outline-offset-2 focus:outline-[var(--input-focus)]\" required=\"\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex gap-1.5 col-span-full @2xl:col-start-2 @2xl:col-span-1 order-2 @lg:order-3\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-6 shrink-0 items-center\">\n                <div cl